    "updated_at": "2023-02-16T03:08:23Z",
    "body": "About the security implications, I was concerned that the proposal was again to disassociate acquisition of the manifest from the document (which provides the security policies for fetching sub-resources). As you explained to me, and as I can see in the PR, that's not impacted: you've only simplified what gets passed from one spec to the other, which is great. \r\n\r\nSo, I think this should be ok. ",
